{"ID":"20240314091932-pxamae0","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240314091932-pxamae0","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240314091932-pxamae0\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422164441-tv0i4w6\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422164441-t04l62x\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422164441-t04l62x\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:34,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:34\u0026#125;","title":"【栀子大黄汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240422164441"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240422164441-tv0i4w6","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240422164441-tv0i4w6","updated":"20240422164441"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"酒疸，心中懊憹，或热痛，栀子大黄汤主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240422164441-zedbre0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164441-zedbre0","updated":"20240422164441"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"栀子大黄汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422164441-qv7uefq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164441-qv7uefq","updated":"20240422164441"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"栀子十枚，大黄三两，枳实五枚，豉一升"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422164441-jv56k6g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164441-jv56k6g","updated":"20240422164441"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右四味，以水六升，煮取二升，分温三服。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422164441-h181udx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164441-h181udx","updated":"20240422164441"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"心中懊脓"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，胃里面很难受，怪怪的感觉，不舒服或者是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"热痛"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，那我们会用栀子大黄，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"栀子是寒凉的药，所以他能去肝胆的热"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，我们一定是看病人的舌头，舌头很黄很热，确定他的脉是很速很热，我们才会开寒凉的药，对不对？如果里面是寒症，里面你怎么会用栀子呢。"}]},{"ID":"20240422164441-5vffp7m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164441-5vffp7m","updated":"20240422164441"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个处方里面没有茵陈，代表这个人没有发黄，有发黄一定会用到茵陈。所以"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"栀子大黄汤和茵陈篙汤的差异就是...这两个都有便秘，差异就是一个黄一个不黄"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。茵陈篙呢非常的黄，栀子大黄呢不黄。"}]},{"ID":"20240422164441-oz4kzj6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164441-oz4kzj6","updated":"20240422164441"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那我们知道这个是酒客病，栀子大黄开处方的时候，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"栀子开五钱，大黄三钱，枳实五钱，豆豉是三钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。基本上大概的处方就是这样子的。我们使用到栀子和豆豉，都是主要是为了去热，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"栀子去肝胆的热，豆豉去胃里面的热，大黄去实，枳实去湿，胃里面的湿"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。前面我们有讲到枳实，小承气汤为什么会有枳实，大承气汤会有枳实，枳实真正的功能是，食物堵在肠胃里面后出不来，只有食物的馊水会出来，枳实就是针对这种情况。当然枳实对心脏很好，在这里是对浊水下流造成这种问题有用。不然如果肠胃里面的浊水下流下去，你没有用枳实把他消掉没有把他解决掉，慢慢它会渗透到膀胱里面去，渗透到膀胱以后小便会很浓稠，就不是水，小便排出来就很困难。"}]},{"ID":"20240422164441-t04l62x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164441-t04l62x","updated":"20240422164441"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以我们刚才讲酒客病，所以酒还是少喝，偶尔喝一点没关系，不要喝太多。"}]}]}